WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
It's very likely you'll visit somewhere with no internet connection

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.560
at some point, whether that's a multi-storey car park, a tunnel or a remote project.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.220
You can just carry on sending your messages and photos as normal.

4
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.880
WhatsApp will then send them as soon as you're back online, just

5
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.000
like your messages come through when you turn off flight mode.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.080
After 15 minutes, if you forget to say done, Quickler will remind you to do so,

7
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.660
and if you still forget, the record will file after 12 hours.
